<title>FRANCE: Radian issues 1.2 bln domestic Ffr 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>Radian issues 1.2 bln domestic Ffr 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic issue was announced by the Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole.</p>
<p>BORROWER - RADIAN</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - CAISSE NATIONALE DE CREDIT AGRICOLE</p>
<p> AMT   1.2 BLN FRF	COUPON     6.00	MATURITY 20.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE  STRAIGHT	   ISS PRICE  100.153   PAY DATE 20.NOV.96</p>
<p>							   ACCRUAL  20.NOV.96</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
